WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
A ten-year-old looks up at the
clergyman who runs her new school,

2
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:06.060
and sees "a black pillar!"

3
00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:08.750
He orders the girls' curls cut off.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.370
Then his own wife and daughters sweep in,

5
00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:14.730
dressed in "velvet, silk, and furs".

6
00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.900
Later come a dying friend
who forgives everyone,

7
00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.650
and a cold missionary bound for India.

8
00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:22.490
Three teachers of faith.

9
00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.660
Whose will Jane choose?

10
00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:29.750
In this mission, you'll see how the
school's treasurer uses religion as power.

11
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.680
You'll weigh Helen Burns's patient faith:

12
00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:35.840
"Love your enemies; bless
them that curse you".

13
00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:38.640
Her gravestone says "Resurgam."

14
00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:42.100
And you'll hear St John's
proposal, as he tells Jane:

15
00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:45.000
"you are formed for labour, not for love."

16
00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:48.530
Your mission: decide
whose faith Jane chooses.
